$ pace begin Write offer --tag offer   # at 09:00
success: true
exit_code: 0
----- stdout -----
Began ad5e "Write offer" at 09:00.
pace keeps its data in [SANDBOX]/home.

----- stderr -----

$ pace hold --outer --reason phone call   # at 10:00
success: true
exit_code: 0
----- stdout -----
Held ad5e at 10:00, interrupted from outside: phone call.

----- stderr -----

$ pace hold --reason Slack   # at 10:05
success: true
exit_code: 0
----- stdout -----
ad5e is held since 10:00; the reason is now: Slack.

----- stderr -----

$ pace resume   # at 10:20
success: true
exit_code: 0
----- stdout -----
Resumed ad5e at 10:20 after 20m held.

----- stderr -----

$ pace catch call the tax office   # at 11:00
success: true
exit_code: 0
----- stdout -----
Caught "call the tax office" on ad5e.

----- stderr -----

$ pace pause --lunch   # at 12:00
success: true
exit_code: 0
----- stdout -----
Paused ad5e at 12:00 for lunch.

----- stderr -----

$ pace resume   # at 12:30
success: true
exit_code: 0
----- stdout -----
Resumed ad5e at 12:30 after 30m paused.

----- stderr -----

$ pace end   # at 13:00
success: true
exit_code: 0
----- stdout -----
Ended ad5e "Write offer" at 13:00 after 3h 10m (4h in all, held 20m, paused 30m).

